# Shell access to the board, carried by group membership.
#
# The operator's account - the one the web interface creates when a user name is
# set - is a member of qunilator-admin, and that is the whole of what grants it
# root. Nothing here names an account, so a change of operator name is a change
# of who is in the group and nothing else.
#
# No password is asked for: the account reaches this board over ssh with a key,
# and a board whose shell someone already holds is a board they can power-cycle
# from the front panel anyway.
%qunilator-admin ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:ALL
